ValueSet: ChEmrPhysicalDisabilityTypesVS
Id: ch-emr-physical-disability-types-vs
Title: "Physical disability types"
Description: "Value set of SNOMED CT codes for physical disabilities, as defined in the eNotfallpass concept (eHealth Suisse, Konzept eNotfallpass, section 3.4.14 'Physische Beeinträchtigung'): Sehbehinderung 397540003 |Visual impairment|, Hörbehinderung 15188001 |Hearing loss|, Gehbehinderung 228158008 |Walking disability|, Cerebralparese 128188000 |Cerebral palsy| and Neuromuskuläre Erkrankung 257277002 |Myoneural disorder|. The concept deliberately combines sensory impairments, a functional limitation and diagnoses; descendants are not included. It is not bound to any profile element. It is provided as implementer help: when a Condition in the Functional Status section of the Emergency Record has a code in this value set, the disability can be classified as physical and rendered accordingly for users."
* ^status = #active
* ^experimental = false
* ^version = "1.0.0"
* ^date = "2026-05-26"

